flowchart TD
    A[Owner opens tap URL with stored secret] --> B(Validate secret against owner token hash)
    B --> C[Fetch artwork facts and private journal blocks]
    C --> D(Mount TipTap block editor in editable mode)
    D --> E[Owner writes reflections or edits prompts]
    E --> F(Debounce timer: 1000ms idle)
    F --> G[Send update request with bearer token]
    G --> H{Validate owner token hash}
    H -->|Valid| I[Update journal entry in database]
    I --> J[Display saved status in UI]
    H -->|Invalid| K[Show sync error and prompt verification]
